sequenceDiagram
    participant DW as DownloadWorker
    participant ROOM as Room
    participant PART as .part file
    participant BK as Backend
    DW->>ROOM: read offset (0) + etag
    DW->>BK: GET Range bytes=0- (If-Range etag)
    BK-->>DW: 206 Partial Content + Content-Length
    loop stream
        DW->>PART: append chunk
        DW->>ROOM: persist offset
    end
    Note over DW,BK: connection drops at 60%
    DW->>ROOM: offset = 60%
    DW->>BK: GET Range bytes=offset- (If-Range etag)
    BK-->>DW: 206 remaining bytes
    DW->>PART: append remaining
    DW->>DW: verify size + sha256
    DW->>PART: rename .part to final
    DW->>ROOM: status = COMPLETE
